OL,3,GNEWSARepairs continue after water
OL,4,Arestored to homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs are ongoing to a large burst
OL,7,Fmain near a Surrey reservoir which
OL,8,Faffected supplies to as many as 15,000
OL,9,Fproperties on Monday morning.
OL,11,FThames Water says supply should now be
OL,12,Frestored to people previously impacted
OL,13,Fby the burst in East Molesey which
OL,14,Faffected homes in Surrey, as well as
OL,15,Fparts of south London.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for the water company
OL,18,Fsaid it was continuing to reroute water
OL,19,Fto keep taps on during the repairs, and
OL,20,Fthat a bottled water station was open
OL,21,Fat Sandown Park Racecourse.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
